# General configuration for all the generated gifs

Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1000
Set Height 400

Set WindowBar Colorful
Set BorderRadius 10
Set Theme "Dracula"

Set Margin 6
Set MarginFill "#2980b9"  # RTD blue

# Setup alias
Hide
Type "alias akcli='poetry run akcli --edgerc $AKCLI_TEST_EDGERC --no-validate-certs' && clear"
Enter
Show

Set TypingSpeed 0.1
